Data Notice
===========

This package may include converted Cambodia administrative address data in
data/cambodia.json or generated package files.

The maintainers do not claim ownership of the original administrative address
data. All original data remains the property of its respective source or rights
holder. The MIT License above applies only to the software code and associated
documentation authored by the kh-address contributors; it does not grant
ownership of or additional rights to third-party data.

The original data is attributed to:

National Committee for Sub-National Democratic Development (NCDD)
https://db.ncdd.gov.kh/

This package is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by NCDD.

If you are an authorized representative of a data source or rights holder and
believe that any bundled data should be corrected, attributed differently,
removed, or deprecated from npm distribution, please contact the maintainers
through the npm package page or the repository issue tracker. Good-faith
requests will be reviewed and may result in corrected attribution, data
removal, or deprecation of affected published versions where necessary.
